(6254792, 924725, 69034, '<td valign="top">The framing on this shot could be improved, and I think the focus could have been shrunk down a bit to focus on few pairs as opposed to this large of a group.</td>', 'The framing on this shot could be improved, and I think the focus could have been shrunk down a bit to focus on few pairs as opposed to this large of a group.', '2010-12-15 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254795, 925157, 69034, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me laugh and random-ness of it coupled with the concept completion is nice.</td>', 'This shot makes me laugh and random-ness of it coupled with the concept completion is nice.', '2010-12-15 12:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254796, 924481, 69034, '<td valign="top">The refelction of the skylight is very glaring in this shot, and I''m not sure if it increases or decreases teh quality of the shot (due to the challenge perameters). . .if it were a bit less prominent I would probably like the shot better.</td>', 'The refelction of the skylight is very glaring in this shot, and I''m not sure if it increases or decreases teh quality of the shot (due to the challenge perameters). . .if it were a bit less prominent I would probably like the shot better.', '2010-12-15 12:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254797, 924808, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such cool textures!  Great b/w</td>', 'Such cool textures!  Great b/w', '2010-12-15 12:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254799, 924964, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is SO wonderful, on so many levels.  It is like an episode of The Addamms Family.  Thing has found the perfect Xmas gift for Gomez, a pickled Giant Squid Brain.  Great lighting, and awesome job of avoiding glare.  The man reaching through the frame is just genius, and the shoes make it seem that he''s some sort of deformed - but very helpful - multi-ped.</td>', 'This is SO wonderful, on so many levels.  It is like an episode of The Addamms Family.  Thing has found the perfect Xmas gift for Gomez, a pickled Giant Squid Brain.  Great lighting, and awesome job of avoiding glare.  The man reaching through the frame is just genius, and the shoes make it seem that he''s some sort of deformed - but very helpful - multi-ped.', '2010-12-15 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254800, 924527, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Could be a product shot.  Will probably land on the front page, although for me this is lacking a bit of story and a little heart.</td>', 'Stunning.  Could be a product shot.  Will probably land on the front page, although for me this is lacking a bit of story and a little heart.', '2010-12-15 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
