(6254803, 925087, 69034, '<td valign="top">Really like the concept on this shop but the colors seem very faded.  I know that shooting indoors creates these kind of issues, but I wish for brighter/crisper color.</td>', 'Really like the concept on this shop but the colors seem very faded.  I know that shooting indoors creates these kind of issues, but I wish for brighter/crisper color.', '2010-12-15 12:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
