(6255182, 925202, 114225, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the overall idea for this (although I see it more as christmas wishing than window shopping). However, the user of flash makes this photo unflattering.</td>', 'I definitely like the overall idea for this (although I see it more as christmas wishing than window shopping). However, the user of flash makes this photo unflattering.', '2010-12-15 21:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
