(6255625, 924527, 101838, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You should really be thankful though to the store manager for arranging the lighting for you.</td>', 'Great capture. You should really be thankful though to the store manager for arranging the lighting for you.', '2010-12-16 13:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6255637, 925093, 83313, '<td valign="top">I almost called this DNMC for being shot through a door instead of a window, then I realized the front of the display case is a window. Kudos for a somewhat sneaky take on the topic. There''s a modest amount of fisheye distortion visible, which can be corrected for under advanced rules.</td>', 'I almost called this DNMC for being shot through a door instead of a window, then I realized the front of the display case is a window. Kudos for a somewhat sneaky take on the topic. There''s a modest amount of fisheye distortion visible, which can be corrected for under advanced rules.', '2010-12-16 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
