(6255784, 924631, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colour, processing, but it''s the reflections in the glasses that really does it for me.</td>', 'Nice composition, colour, processing, but it''s the reflections in the glasses that really does it for me.', '2010-12-16 17:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
