(6255978, 924528, 117534, '<td valign="top">This photo is so perfect, you make me want to go to this store! super processing ,,, if this don'' t win the blue It has to be one of the top three!  (this would make a real nice Christmas card!) 10</td>', 'This photo is so perfect, you make me want to go to this store! super processing ,,, if this don'' t win the blue It has to be one of the top three!  (this would make a real nice Christmas card!) 10', '2010-12-16 23:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6255980, 924631, 117534, '<td valign="top">I''ve given 3 10''s in this challenge.. this is the 3rd one, what an awesome job you did here! the softness and blending of the hats and the stark sharpness of the reflection in his (lol his) glasses.. Just blows me away! 10</td>', 'I''ve given 3 10''s in this challenge.. this is the 3rd one, what an awesome job you did here! the softness and blending of the hats and the stark sharpness of the reflection in his (lol his) glasses.. Just blows me away! 10', '2010-12-16 23:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6255981, 925157, 117534, '<td valign="top">Perfect timeing, Great capture!!!! Have you heard the song Pants on da floor?</td>', 'Perfect timeing, Great capture!!!! Have you heard the song Pants on da floor?', '2010-12-16 23:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256056, 924812, 115307, '<td valign="top">Loving the double reflection, but not too fond that I can see you in it. Still, that is totally personal preference so not dinging you on that. Plus I decided that it actually creates a fairly dynamic composition by creating a triangle between the wheel,biker and you. <br/>Probably personally would have cropped out the wall on the left. This shot is meant to be intentionally abstract with its layers, so why ground us by giving us a sense of place? Again, just my opinion. Great black and white conversion by the way. 6</td>', 'Loving the double reflection, but not too fond that I can see you in it. Still, that is totally personal preference so not dinging you on that. Plus I decided that it actually creates a fairly dynamic composition by creating a triangle between the wheel,biker and you. Probably personally would have cropped out the wall on the left. This shot is meant to be intentionally abstract with its layers, so why ground us by giving us a sense of place? Again, just my opinion. Great black and white conversion by the way. 6', '2010-12-17 01:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256061, 924384, 115307, '<td valign="top">So bizarre and interesting. I was entertained for quite a while, deciding whether the girl was real or not, whether the dark shape in the reflection is you or not, whether its a nativity scene etc.<br/>I do hate those two lights in the left corner though. They absolutely completely do not match with the rest of the ''feel'' of the picture in my opinion. <br/>Good job in telling a story...or rather, letting us invent one.</td>', 'So bizarre and interesting. I was entertained for quite a while, deciding whether the girl was real or not, whether the dark shape in the reflection is you or not, whether its a nativity scene etc.I do hate those two lights in the left corner though. They absolutely completely do not match with the rest of the ''feel'' of the picture in my opinion. Good job in telling a story...or rather, letting us invent one.', '2010-12-17 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256062, 924481, 115307, '<td valign="top">The best thing about taking a picture of a window, what''s behind it, and its reflection, is that the picture tells multiple stories in one. This bizarre effect lets the viewer dive into the photo, analyzing and observing what is going on. Unfortunately, neither of these stories are very interesting to me in this picture.</td>', 'The best thing about taking a picture of a window, what''s behind it, and its reflection, is that the picture tells multiple stories in one. This bizarre effect lets the viewer dive into the photo, analyzing and observing what is going on. Unfortunately, neither of these stories are very interesting to me in this picture.', '2010-12-17 01:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256064, 924693, 115307, '<td valign="top">This photo meets the challenge well. The boy certainly looks like he is coveting this car. I also love the complementing reds in this photograph, though obviously the store did that on purpose</td>', 'This photo meets the challenge well. The boy certainly looks like he is coveting this car. I also love the complementing reds in this photograph, though obviously the store did that on purpose', '2010-12-17 01:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256065, 925161, 115307, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this is an interesting voting dilemma. It appears to meet the challenge with a store,window etc. My main problem is that point of main interest (the orange painting) is not within these bounds and therefore not really meeting the challenge for me. Still, the store does provide context for the painting, which is important.<br/>Anyways, thats just me thinking to myself. I really like the color tones, where the painting is located in the frame, and the contrast between dark window panels and light window panels.</td>', 'Hmm, this is an interesting voting dilemma. It appears to meet the challenge with a store,window etc. My main problem is that point of main interest (the orange painting) is not within these bounds and therefore not really meeting the challenge for me. Still, the store does provide context for the painting, which is important.Anyways, thats just me thinking to myself. I really like the color tones, where the painting is located in the frame, and the contrast between dark window panels and light window panels.', '2010-12-17 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256066, 925005, 115307, '<td valign="top">What first struck me in this image was the complementing colors of the lamp shade and the walls. Then your title gave me further connection between the curves of each. The menorah acts as a nice random added interest. Unfortunately, it is not at all appealing to me to look out of the windows, and that goes for both the left and the right one, which makes it hard to vote this high, when the challenge meeting portion of the image is not very interesting.</td>', 'What first struck me in this image was the complementing colors of the lamp shade and the walls. Then your title gave me further connection between the curves of each. The menorah acts as a nice random added interest. Unfortunately, it is not at all appealing to me to look out of the windows, and that goes for both the left and the right one, which makes it hard to vote this high, when the challenge meeting portion of the image is not very interesting.', '2010-12-17 01:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256067, 925217, 115307, '<td valign="top">If the angle of this shot could have been slightly different, I think it could have been a much more powerful shot. I feel like there really needs to be some space between the right foreground watch and the middle in focus one. If there was, there would be a nice sense of balance to the photo, as the two watches on the outsides work to frame the middle one and provide a sense of depth. <br/>This way the middle watch just feels crowded. Just one of those images where all of the technicals are there, it just needs that small little push in composition to make it work.</td>', 'If the angle of this shot could have been slightly different, I think it could have been a much more powerful shot. I feel like there really needs to be some space between the right foreground watch and the middle in focus one. If there was, there would be a nice sense of balance to the photo, as the two watches on the outsides work to frame the middle one and provide a sense of depth. This way the middle watch just feels crowded. Just one of those images where all of the technicals are there, it just needs that small little push in composition to make it work.', '2010-12-17 01:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256069, 924701, 115307, '<td valign="top">Interesting, that you chose an angle from below the person at the window. Any reason why? It makes me very curious as to the reasoning. Not that it is bad, just that it is unusual compared to what else I have seen in the challenge so far. I like the sepia here, and it fits the challenge great. Would have wished that the person would have been slightly more in focus though. Or maybe I like it this way. I can''t decide.</td>', 'Interesting, that you chose an angle from below the person at the window. Any reason why? It makes me very curious as to the reasoning. Not that it is bad, just that it is unusual compared to what else I have seen in the challenge so far. I like the sepia here, and it fits the challenge great. Would have wished that the person would have been slightly more in focus though. Or maybe I like it this way. I can''t decide.', '2010-12-17 01:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256071, 925212, 115307, '<td valign="top">The title made me think more than the picture did, trying to figure out the connection between it and the photo.<br/>You certainly captured the sheer overwhelming-ness of all of the signs both in the store and on the window. Everywhere I look, signs signs signs. I would have loved to see a human element in this, just to connect further with the viewer and add some impact. A "so what?" if you will. The shopping cart tempts me in that direction, but not quite enough.</td>', 'The title made me think more than the picture did, trying to figure out the connection between it and the photo.You certainly captured the sheer overwhelming-ness of all of the signs both in the store and on the window. Everywhere I look, signs signs signs. I would have loved to see a human element in this, just to connect further with the viewer and add some impact. A "so what?" if you will. The shopping cart tempts me in that direction, but not quite enough.', '2010-12-17 01:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256073, 925231, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous display. The subject matter is interesting, the complementary blues visually pleasing. Far and beyond for me are the snowflakes that frame the picture. This is my favorite so far in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous display. The subject matter is interesting, the complementary blues visually pleasing. Far and beyond for me are the snowflakes that frame the picture. This is my favorite so far in this challenge.', '2010-12-17 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256074, 925208, 115307, '<td valign="top">This picture has beautiful tones no doubt, but I am having a very hard time connecting it to the challenge. Even if you took this through a window, the picture itself is not telling me that.</td>', 'This picture has beautiful tones no doubt, but I am having a very hard time connecting it to the challenge. Even if you took this through a window, the picture itself is not telling me that.', '2010-12-17 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256075, 924598, 115307, '<td valign="top">What I like best about this picture is the double border. One created naturally and the other added later. Makes a really cool effect. The pole of christmas lights is much more interesting to me than the actual window display, but that isn''t so bad either. I just don''t like the grain much. 6</td>', 'What I like best about this picture is the double border. One created naturally and the other added later. Makes a really cool effect. The pole of christmas lights is much more interesting to me than the actual window display, but that isn''t so bad either. I just don''t like the grain much. 6', '2010-12-17 01:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256076, 924527, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very stylish and well photographed. The store sellers sure do know their lighting, that is for sure. All of the matching tones really bring out this image, and the composition is pretty fine as well. My second favorite image so far (granted I am not even half way done, sorry :-P)</td>', 'Very stylish and well photographed. The store sellers sure do know their lighting, that is for sure. All of the matching tones really bring out this image, and the composition is pretty fine as well. My second favorite image so far (granted I am not even half way done, sorry :-P)', '2010-12-17 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256077, 924684, 115307, '<td valign="top">Oooh, a much more interesting kind of store than some others I have seen so far. Good choice to take it at night to get those lanterns really glowing. I also think that the people element is really important in this picture.<br/>I would have cropped out the left door entirely though, it really adds nothing interesting to the photograph to me. Everything interesting occurs to the right of it. Anyways, I really like this shot 7</td>', 'Oooh, a much more interesting kind of store than some others I have seen so far. Good choice to take it at night to get those lanterns really glowing. I also think that the people element is really important in this picture.I would have cropped out the left door entirely though, it really adds nothing interesting to the photograph to me. Everything interesting occurs to the right of it. Anyways, I really like this shot 7', '2010-12-17 01:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256078, 925202, 115307, '<td valign="top">Is it snowing? I really like that :-)<br/>Anyways, strong composition and it fits the challenge really really well. Something bugs me about the lighting on hte girl though. I feel like it should be a lot warmer. The color tones are too cold for me.<br/>It must have been really difficult to expose that tree like you did. Excellent job 7</td>', 'Is it snowing? I really like that :-)Anyways, strong composition and it fits the challenge really really well. Something bugs me about the lighting on hte girl though. I feel like it should be a lot warmer. The color tones are too cold for me.It must have been really difficult to expose that tree like you did. Excellent job 7', '2010-12-17 01:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256080, 924622, 115307, '<td valign="top">Are those chocolate cauldrons? Bizarre! And worth so much money!<br/>Very interesting photo that gave me a lot of look at and certainly fits the challenge.<br/>The weirdest thing has got to be those vegetables next to the window 7</td>', 'Are those chocolate cauldrons? Bizarre! And worth so much money!Very interesting photo that gave me a lot of look at and certainly fits the challenge.The weirdest thing has got to be those vegetables next to the window 7', '2010-12-17 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256081, 925015, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very classy, I quite like this. The composition is most excellent, and I love the out of focus foreground elements (something that is rare for me). Very well done, I don''t know how you could have photographed this one better. 8</td>', 'Very classy, I quite like this. The composition is most excellent, and I love the out of focus foreground elements (something that is rare for me). Very well done, I don''t know how you could have photographed this one better. 8', '2010-12-17 01:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256082, 925008, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo with so many things to look at. I would have zoomed in slightly more, so the viewers could read the sign without straining their eyes. I am trying, but its a little too small for me. This way, it just bugs me that I juuuuuust quite can''t read it :-P 7</td>', 'Very interesting photo with so many things to look at. I would have zoomed in slightly more, so the viewers could read the sign without straining their eyes. I am trying, but its a little too small for me. This way, it just bugs me that I juuuuuust quite can''t read it :-P 7', '2010-12-17 02:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256084, 924964, 115307, '<td valign="top">How very bizarre. I can''t quite understand this picture. How are there reflections in the frame when clearly it must be empty. How wonderful to contemplate.<br/>I find the second person on the left to be completely useless in the photo though. I am entirely not interested in him. And to put insult to injury his hand is overexposed.<br/> <br/>Oh wow, just as I was about to vote and continue, I realized that the reflections are actually on the window that YOU are shooting through, not the frame that he was going through. Tricked me ;-)</td>', 'How very bizarre. I can''t quite understand this picture. How are there reflections in the frame when clearly it must be empty. How wonderful to contemplate.I find the second person on the left to be completely useless in the photo though. I am entirely not interested in him. And to put insult to injury his hand is overexposed. Oh wow, just as I was about to vote and continue, I realized that the reflections are actually on the window that YOU are shooting through, not the frame that he was going through. Tricked me ;-)', '2010-12-17 02:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256087, 925215, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks like a child''s dream. I really love the color tones of this picture.<br/>I am a little baffled, because I really dislike the metal fence in the picture, but can''t really find a suitable suggestion of how you could have gotten rid of it or less noticeable, without also making the composition less interesting. <br/>Ah well, its not a big deal anyways 7</td>', 'Wow, this looks like a child''s dream. I really love the color tones of this picture.I am a little baffled, because I really dislike the metal fence in the picture, but can''t really find a suitable suggestion of how you could have gotten rid of it or less noticeable, without also making the composition less interesting. Ah well, its not a big deal anyways 7', '2010-12-17 02:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256089, 924749, 115307, '<td valign="top">If there ever was a window shot that needed a reflection visible, its this one.<br/>Its such a nice window display, but I really feel it would be a lot stronger if it added the interest of telling another story as well via the reflection 6</td>', 'If there ever was a window shot that needed a reflection visible, its this one.Its such a nice window display, but I really feel it would be a lot stronger if it added the interest of telling another story as well via the reflection 6', '2010-12-17 02:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256090, 925157, 115307, '<td valign="top">A well taken image that meets the challenge and is even funny, but unfortunately the subject matter is very unappealing to me. I''ll just quickly vote and move on, so that I don''t have to analyze this too long 6</td>', 'A well taken image that meets the challenge and is even funny, but unfortunately the subject matter is very unappealing to me. I''ll just quickly vote and move on, so that I don''t have to analyze this too long 6', '2010-12-17 02:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256092, 925134, 115307, '<td valign="top">Loving the perspective. One of the most unique of the entire challenge. I just now noticed the footprints in the snow which are very interesting to me. Love how there are two of one world, but only of the other, if that makes sense. I probably would have gone for a slightly closer crop though. Right now it feels a little to disconnected for me. 8</td>', 'Loving the perspective. One of the most unique of the entire challenge. I just now noticed the footprints in the snow which are very interesting to me. Love how there are two of one world, but only of the other, if that makes sense. I probably would have gone for a slightly closer crop though. Right now it feels a little to disconnected for me. 8', '2010-12-17 02:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256094, 925233, 115307, '<td valign="top">A well taken photograph that just lacks the little ''extra'' element to make this picture pop like the some of this challenges frontrunners. 6</td>', 'A well taken photograph that just lacks the little ''extra'' element to make this picture pop like the some of this challenges frontrunners. 6', '2010-12-17 02:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256096, 924742, 115307, '<td valign="top">Despite the title, that guy in the front is really not doing it for me. I think the image would have been stronger without it. The display itself is very nice, and I like that you can see the people in the store. The out of focus guy especially exiting the frame is an eye sore for me. Maybe entering the frame he would have had more impact.</td>', 'Despite the title, that guy in the front is really not doing it for me. I think the image would have been stronger without it. The display itself is very nice, and I like that you can see the people in the store. The out of focus guy especially exiting the frame is an eye sore for me. Maybe entering the frame he would have had more impact.', '2010-12-17 02:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256097, 924941, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love how the reflection is visible in one half of the picture but not the other. It really creates a nice sense of the lighting going on here. I love this image tones, and I especially like that red cable that is hanging there with its shadow. Probably would have cropped the top most area off though. The green squiggly canopy thing is very distracting to me. <br/>I like this 8</td>', 'I love how the reflection is visible in one half of the picture but not the other. It really creates a nice sense of the lighting going on here. I love this image tones, and I especially like that red cable that is hanging there with its shadow. Probably would have cropped the top most area off though. The green squiggly canopy thing is very distracting to me. I like this 8', '2010-12-17 02:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256212, 925212, 93283, '<td valign="top">HaHA... Great title... Good connection to your theme :)</td>', 'HaHA... Great title... Good connection to your theme :)', '2010-12-17 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256214, 925157, 93283, '<td valign="top">LMAO...</td>', 'LMAO...', '2010-12-17 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256215, 925087, 93283, '<td valign="top">There is something seriously creepy about this image... and I must say, Santa doesn''t look the same since going on the Atkins diet... Funny capture though</td>', 'There is something seriously creepy about this image... and I must say, Santa doesn''t look the same since going on the Atkins diet... Funny capture though', '2010-12-17 10:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256275, 925005, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very impresive image,nicely done.</td>', 'Very impresive image,nicely done.', '2010-12-17 13:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256277, 925098, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like this image.</td>', 'I like this image.', '2010-12-17 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256279, 924701, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the toning,has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'Like the toning,has a nice feel to it.', '2010-12-17 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256281, 925218, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting you have here.</td>', 'I like the lighting you have here.', '2010-12-17 13:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256283, 925015, 118154, '<td valign="top">For me the bottle in the front spoils it a bit.</td>', 'For me the bottle in the front spoils it a bit.', '2010-12-17 13:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256286, 924693, 118154, '<td valign="top">This image really stands out,like the cartoonyness.</td>', 'This image really stands out,like the cartoonyness.', '2010-12-17 13:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256289, 925148, 118154, '<td valign="top">Cute,guess the softness is what you wanted ?</td>', 'Cute,guess the softness is what you wanted ?', '2010-12-17 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256307, 924527, 92577, '<td valign="top">you''ve captured the up-market image very well. good luck</td>', 'you''ve captured the up-market image very well. good luck', '2010-12-17 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256334, 924965, 115307, '<td valign="top">She has a very comical expression. I actually like the centralized composition here. The overall picture is a little too cluttered and lacking focus for me though. Just too much going on</td>', 'She has a very comical expression. I actually like the centralized composition here. The overall picture is a little too cluttered and lacking focus for me though. Just too much going on', '2010-12-17 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256339, 925170, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like this. I think the tilt really works here. It makes it feel like everything is tumbling to the left side.<br/>The window on the left guys coat is especially bizarre. 6</td>', 'Nice, I like this. I think the tilt really works here. It makes it feel like everything is tumbling to the left side.The window on the left guys coat is especially bizarre. 6', '2010-12-17 14:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256342, 924528, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a bizarre window display. I like the composition of the "Elson and Taylor" sign cutting through the picture and separating the display. 8 from me, I just love the bizarreness</td>', 'Wow, what a bizarre window display. I like the composition of the "Elson and Taylor" sign cutting through the picture and separating the display. 8 from me, I just love the bizarreness', '2010-12-17 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6256344, 925241, 115307, '<td valign="top">The fact that jalapeno and cinnamon are cut off is just not working for me here. I really think that they needed to be in the frame completely. Just a little wider of a shot would have made this a lot stronger.</td>', 'The fact that jalapeno and cinnamon are cut off is just not working for me here. I really think that they needed to be in the frame completely. Just a little wider of a shot would have made this a lot stronger.', '2010-12-17 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256346, 924785, 61222, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!!</td>', 'This is so cool!!', '2010-12-17 14:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256348, 925231, 61222, '<td valign="top">Love this. Great Job!!!</td>', 'Love this. Great Job!!!', '2010-12-17 14:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256349, 924808, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I love the natural border made by the wall, and especially love the intense expression on that guys face as he stares at a display. You got a real gem here. This photo has such character.<br/>I do dislike the light line running through the piano players head, but there wasn''t anything you could have done about that.</td>', 'This is awesome. I love the natural border made by the wall, and especially love the intense expression on that guys face as he stares at a display. You got a real gem here. This photo has such character.I do dislike the light line running through the piano players head, but there wasn''t anything you could have done about that.', '2010-12-17 14:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256351, 924785, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very nice. In my opinion a tiny bit strong on the processing, but just a tiny bit, I like the general feel of it. I like the composition. 7</td>', 'Very nice. In my opinion a tiny bit strong on the processing, but just a tiny bit, I like the general feel of it. I like the composition. 7', '2010-12-17 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256353, 925227, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely lit, and I like where the dress is situated in the frame. I would have personally used a slightly smaller depth of focus so that that background material would have been more blurry.</td>', 'This is very nicely lit, and I like where the dress is situated in the frame. I would have personally used a slightly smaller depth of focus so that that background material would have been more blurry.', '2010-12-17 14:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256355, 924864, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the double reflection and the fact that the reflected building wall matches the color tones of the radio.</td>', 'I like the double reflection and the fact that the reflected building wall matches the color tones of the radio.', '2010-12-17 14:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256357, 925025, 115307, '<td valign="top">There are many many window reflection pictures in this challenge. But this is the first one that shows the mirror effect with text being shown the wrong way. I really like that about this photo.<br/>I would have cropped out the lower bit though. That tubing (vacuum cleaner?) is just too weird to me. 6</td>', 'There are many many window reflection pictures in this challenge. But this is the first one that shows the mirror effect with text being shown the wrong way. I really like that about this photo.I would have cropped out the lower bit though. That tubing (vacuum cleaner?) is just too weird to me. 6', '2010-12-17 14:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256365, 924570, 115307, '<td valign="top">This shot must have been really hard to expose properly. I wish the santas fact wasn''t so overexposed, but I completely understand that it must have been impossible to the get enough reflection or to expose the tree well (which is done perfectly) without doing so. Love the added interest of the tree also reflected in a mirror on the left.</td>', 'This shot must have been really hard to expose properly. I wish the santas fact wasn''t so overexposed, but I completely understand that it must have been impossible to the get enough reflection or to expose the tree well (which is done perfectly) without doing so. Love the added interest of the tree also reflected in a mirror on the left.', '2010-12-17 14:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256369, 924725, 115307, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, and is exposed properly, in focus etc. For me, this photo is just not as interesting as many in this challenge however. Especially the empty floor on the right is very bland.<br/>I do like how the red sign stands out from all the other dull colors.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, and is exposed properly, in focus etc. For me, this photo is just not as interesting as many in this challenge however. Especially the empty floor on the right is very bland.I do like how the red sign stands out from all the other dull colors.', '2010-12-17 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256370, 924572, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really love the blue color tone throughout this picture, the lighting is very very nice. I don''t know what that thing that is poking out of the right frame is though. it is kind of weird to me and doesn''t contribute much to the photo.<br/>The vignetting is a nice touch. 6</td>', 'I really love the blue color tone throughout this picture, the lighting is very very nice. I don''t know what that thing that is poking out of the right frame is though. it is kind of weird to me and doesn''t contribute much to the photo.The vignetting is a nice touch. 6', '2010-12-17 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256373, 924887, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture. I do think its much more of a portrait and not really emphasizing the window front. Maybe if her hair was down, it would draw more attention to the ''hair cuts'' aspect.<br/>You gotta love how the pinks match throughout the photo, on her AND the display 6</td>', 'Very cute picture. I do think its much more of a portrait and not really emphasizing the window front. Maybe if her hair was down, it would draw more attention to the ''hair cuts'' aspect.You gotta love how the pinks match throughout the photo, on her AND the display 6', '2010-12-17 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256378, 925204, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great shot, different from the rest of this challenge. The fact that you can see that he is on his tippy toes is a nice touch to the photo. I do wish that that other guy wasn''t in the frame, he is kinda distracting. But nothing you could have done about that. 6</td>', 'Great shot, different from the rest of this challenge. The fact that you can see that he is on his tippy toes is a nice touch to the photo. I do wish that that other guy wasn''t in the frame, he is kinda distracting. But nothing you could have done about that. 6', '2010-12-17 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256382, 925093, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the natural framing caused by the green door way, its a nice touch.<br/>I might have upped the contrast some more in editing, the picture comes off a little flat. The lack of window makes it hard to. I feel like it meets the challenge because it is of a store, but the description does explicitly ask for windows in some way.</td>', 'I love the natural framing caused by the green door way, its a nice touch.I might have upped the contrast some more in editing, the picture comes off a little flat. The lack of window makes it hard to. I feel like it meets the challenge because it is of a store, but the description does explicitly ask for windows in some way.', '2010-12-17 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256384, 924689, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am loving the editing done on this. The muted color tones are very nice.<br/>I think a lower angle would have been even more effecting by adding more impact.<br/>Eye level is always the best, and that bear does have eyes :-) 6</td>', 'I am loving the editing done on this. The muted color tones are very nice.I think a lower angle would have been even more effecting by adding more impact.Eye level is always the best, and that bear does have eyes :-) 6', '2010-12-17 15:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256387, 925098, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love looking at this photo and trying to decide the story behind it. Very interesting to look at.<br/>I understand that in editing you probably emphasized the yellow tinge on purpose, but it does come off a bit strong to me. 6</td>', 'I love looking at this photo and trying to decide the story behind it. Very interesting to look at.I understand that in editing you probably emphasized the yellow tinge on purpose, but it does come off a bit strong to me. 6', '2010-12-17 15:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256389, 925218, 115307, '<td valign="top">Lol, that glaring obnoxious open sign directly clashes will everything else in this photo that is so completely classy. I wonder what the store people were thinking! i am really loving that clash. Also loving the composition and that awesome stone wall. 7</td>', 'Lol, that glaring obnoxious open sign directly clashes will everything else in this photo that is so completely classy. I wonder what the store people were thinking! i am really loving that clash. Also loving the composition and that awesome stone wall. 7', '2010-12-17 15:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256392, 924480, 115307, '<td valign="top">This one is hard for me to decide on. Everything in this photo screams awkward to me, the angle, the window reflections, the fact the text is cut off etc. On the one hand I don''t like the awkwardness, on the other hand, if that was your intention you succeeded masterfully, which should be rewarded. Anyways, it does meet the challenge well.</td>', 'This one is hard for me to decide on. Everything in this photo screams awkward to me, the angle, the window reflections, the fact the text is cut off etc. On the one hand I don''t like the awkwardness, on the other hand, if that was your intention you succeeded masterfully, which should be rewarded. Anyways, it does meet the challenge well.', '2010-12-17 15:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256395, 924631, 115307, '<td valign="top">There are many reflection shots in this challenge. But THIS is masterful. By far outperforms the others. I also love the editing you have chosen here. Topaz?<br/>Really great shot, so very much to look at and to like. 9</td>', 'There are many reflection shots in this challenge. But THIS is masterful. By far outperforms the others. I also love the editing you have chosen here. Topaz?Really great shot, so very much to look at and to like. 9', '2010-12-17 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256396, 925105, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great framing and overall composition. I am loving the lighting shadows on those mannequins. 7</td>', 'Great framing and overall composition. I am loving the lighting shadows on those mannequins. 7', '2010-12-17 15:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256397, 925087, 115307, '<td valign="top">Awesome humor in this photograph, and meets the challenge very well. I do think the focus is a little soft. Some topaz or something like that would have been great for this photo. I also would have tried to get rid of some of that yellow color cast.<br/>This picture made me smile :-) 6</td>', 'Awesome humor in this photograph, and meets the challenge very well. I do think the focus is a little soft. Some topaz or something like that would have been great for this photo. I also would have tried to get rid of some of that yellow color cast.This picture made me smile :-) 6', '2010-12-17 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256398, 924511, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really like the editing and it is a very interesting photo with a lot to look at. But I am missing the "window shopping" aspect. Would have scored this one higher in a free study, it is very interesting. Just not right for this challenge in my opinionn 5</td>', 'I really like the editing and it is a very interesting photo with a lot to look at. But I am missing the "window shopping" aspect. Would have scored this one higher in a free study, it is very interesting. Just not right for this challenge in my opinionn 5', '2010-12-17 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256400, 925148, 115307, '<td valign="top">What an adorable pouting expression she has. And for once I think the border adds  a nice touch.<br/>The portrait comes off a bit too soft for me though, I think it needs just a bit more focus .6</td>', 'What an adorable pouting expression she has. And for once I think the border adds  a nice touch.The portrait comes off a bit too soft for me though, I think it needs just a bit more focus .6', '2010-12-17 15:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256402, 925180, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really love how the mannequin really does appear to be connecting with the camera, and therefore with the viewer. Who knew that an inanimate object could could connect like that. The yellow color cast is fairly glaring for me though, I would have tried to do some correcting with curves. 7</td>', 'I really love how the mannequin really does appear to be connecting with the camera, and therefore with the viewer. Who knew that an inanimate object could could connect like that. The yellow color cast is fairly glaring for me though, I would have tried to do some correcting with curves. 7', '2010-12-17 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256404, 925130, 115307, '<td valign="top">Its too funny that you can''t actually really see the first girls reflection, but you can see the two girls that are blocked off by here. Gives the impression of two completely different worlds, rather than a reflection of the one. I really like that.<br/>I very much dislike the pink color cast though. Its too strong for me.<br/>I think I would have tried to make this shot a vertical one, cutting out the stuff on the right within the window and also cutting off the left half face of the guy.<br/>Great shot. 6</td>', 'Its too funny that you can''t actually really see the first girls reflection, but you can see the two girls that are blocked off by here. Gives the impression of two completely different worlds, rather than a reflection of the one. I really like that.I very much dislike the pink color cast though. Its too strong for me.I think I would have tried to make this shot a vertical one, cutting out the stuff on the right within the window and also cutting off the left half face of the guy.Great shot. 6', '2010-12-17 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256545, 924528, 123833, '<td valign="top">Very different and unusual, nice colors</td>', 'Very different and unusual, nice colors', '2010-12-17 20:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256546, 924527, 123833, '<td valign="top">Great angle and does look expensive, really good sharpness and great colors - top photo</td>', 'Great angle and does look expensive, really good sharpness and great colors - top photo', '2010-12-17 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256727, 924527, 113142, '<td valign="top">If you have to ask, you can''t afford it!</td>', 'If you have to ask, you can''t afford it!', '2010-12-18 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256863, 924742, 116649, '<td valign="top">Love your theme, ties well to your title.</td>', 'Love your theme, ties well to your title.', '2010-12-18 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256864, 924384, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the blur adds anything to this image, it just seems out of focus.</td>', 'I don''t feel the blur adds anything to this image, it just seems out of focus.', '2010-12-18 14:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256866, 924527, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and clarity, and I like the rich tones.</td>', 'Beautiful light and clarity, and I like the rich tones.', '2010-12-18 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256867, 925148, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, but it seems out of place in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, but it seems out of place in this challenge.', '2010-12-18 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257033, 924511, 38032, '<td valign="top">wow -very interesting!</td>', 'wow -very interesting!', '2010-12-18 19:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257121, 924964, 91360, '<td valign="top">GREAT IDEA!(Though, the hands are a little buned..)</td>', 'GREAT IDEA!(Though, the hands are a little buned..)', '2010-12-18 22:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257199, 925215, 121228, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!</td>', 'AWESOME!', '2010-12-19 02:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257200, 925180, 121228, '<td valign="top">WHAT IS THE FOCAL POINT IN THE PHOTO?  JUST KIDDING,  ITS AN AWESOME SHOT!</td>', 'WHAT IS THE FOCAL POINT IN THE PHOTO?  JUST KIDDING,  ITS AN AWESOME SHOT!', '2010-12-19 02:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257231, 924631, 110403, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and special pic. howoever abit messy for me.</td>', 'Very sharp and special pic. howoever abit messy for me.', '2010-12-19 06:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257694, 925170, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is such an intriguing image that has so much to tell without explaining anything.  I find the angle works quite well as well as the b&amp;w.  My equal top pick for the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'This is such an intriguing image that has so much to tell without explaining anything.  I find the angle works quite well as well as the b&w.  My equal top pick for the challenge.  Well done!', '2010-12-19 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257696, 924701, 40391, '<td valign="top">The focal point, DoF, lighting, composition and duotone all work so well together here.  The title just adds that extra chapter to the story being told in this image.  This was my equal top pick for the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'The focal point, DoF, lighting, composition and duotone all work so well together here.  The title just adds that extra chapter to the story being told in this image.  This was my equal top pick for the challenge.  Well done!', '2010-12-19 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257730, 924693, 91342, '<td valign="top">The angle perspective of the window is appealing.</td>', 'The angle perspective of the window is appealing.', '2010-12-19 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257731, 924631, 91342, '<td valign="top">I like this image, though I find it a bit confusing, a bit busy.</td>', 'I like this image, though I find it a bit confusing, a bit busy.', '2010-12-19 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257734, 924864, 91342, '<td valign="top">a nice concept</td>', 'a nice concept', '2010-12-19 21:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257735, 924749, 91342, '<td valign="top">Nice image of the inside.  I especially like the blur/vignette effect.  Not sure if it is part of the window or something you added.</td>', 'Nice image of the inside.  I especially like the blur/vignette effect.  Not sure if it is part of the window or something you added.', '2010-12-19 21:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257737, 924527, 91342, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is wonderful.</td>', 'The simplicity is wonderful.', '2010-12-19 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257738, 925180, 91342, '<td valign="top">Nice trick of model appearing to be doing the shopping.</td>', 'Nice trick of model appearing to be doing the shopping.', '2010-12-19 21:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6257740, 924742, 91342, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  Perhaps someone glancing at the window would help support the title.</td>', 'Like the idea.  Perhaps someone glancing at the window would help support the title.', '2010-12-19 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
