(6259589, 924570, 122823, '<td valign="top">Hi guys thanks for the comments, it was indeed a tough situation but I thought the multiple reflections would make it cool. Giantmike, there was no flash used actually, I don''t know why you thought that. The nutcracker man was illuminated internally. Other than the tree he was the only light provided in the window.</td>', 'Hi guys thanks for the comments, it was indeed a tough situation but I thought the multiple reflections would make it cool. Giantmike, there was no flash used actually, I don''t know why you thought that. The nutcracker man was illuminated internally. Other than the tree he was the only light provided in the window.', '2010-12-22 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
