(6260224, 924964, 60868, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your votes and your comments. It is a shop in Lyon which sells all kind of strange things. At the time I was passing, it wasn''t open, so I couldn''t see in more details the cameras. I noticed the blown highlights, but I didn''t have too much time to take the picture - the two men were moving all the time, and there were also a lot of people in front, which showed as reflection in the glass.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your votes and your comments. It is a shop in Lyon which sells all kind of strange things. At the time I was passing, it wasn''t open, so I couldn''t see in more details the cameras. I noticed the blown highlights, but I didn''t have too much time to take the picture - the two men were moving all the time, and there were also a lot of people in front, which showed as reflection in the glass.', '2010-12-23 05:58:55.000000', NULL, 0),
